{"id":"en_my-role-playing-system-made-me-a-legend","title":"My Role-Playing System Made Me a Legend!","titleEn":"My Role-Playing System Made Me a Legend!","description":"A woman from the present day wakes up in the body of a noble family's daughter, and before she has settled into her new life, she is banished on her very first day. She possesses a strange gift: whatever role she takes on, she can truly become that person. This lets her turn hopeless circumstances into triumphs, overcome her foes, and draw influential people to her side. Yet the further she ventures, the more hidden truths come to light. Those wanting to follow the series can do so on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-role-playing-system-made-me-a-legend/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-role-playing-system-made-me-a-legend/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Ancient Times","Life OL","Time Travel","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dan2o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-role-playing-system-made-me-a-legend_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dan2o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-role-playing-system-made-me-a-legend_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dan2o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-role-playing-system-made-me-a-legend_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dan2o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-role-playing-system-made-me-a-legend_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4